/*
  FlagEditDrawer.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal / dialog · 0019 · FlagEditDrawer (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `FlagEditDrawer`
  resolves (table "FlagEditDrawer") lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These
  entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are
  kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing
  the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/admin/components/feature-flags/FlagEditDrawer.tsx): the drawer titles, the Save / Cancel
  actions, and the key / value / reason field labels, placeholders, and validation copy. The second
  group backs the native chrome (the header close affordance, the loading / empty / error envelopes,
  the P4 freshness / cached-data copy) and the VoiceOver-only "Empty" placeholder so the Swift
  sources hold no English literals.
*/

